<title>SWITZERLAND: SBC lowers some cash bond rates.</title>
<headline>SBC lowers some cash bond rates.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp said it was lowering the interest rate on some of its cash bonds (Kassenobligationen) with effect from July 9.</p>
<p> CASH BOND		 NEW RATE	   OLD RATE</p>
<p> Two years		  1.50 pct	   1.75 pct</p>
<p> Three years		1.75 pct	   2.00 pct</p>
<p> Four years		 2.25 pct	   2.25 pct</p>
<p> Five years		 2.50 pct	   2.50 pct</p>
<p> Six years		  2.75 pct	   2.75 pct</p>
<p> Seven years		3.00 pct	   3.00 pct</p>
<p> Eight years		3.00 pct	   3.25 pct</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
